  "description": "A floating skull on a purple ghost body. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 1500 mm tall (1413 x 1010 x 1500 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 2 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/ghost-skull/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 3144 triangles.",
